<title>SINGAPORE: Transmarco managing director resigns.</title>
<headline>Transmarco managing director resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading and telecommunications company Transmarco Ltd said on Tuesday its director and managing director, Steven Baker, had resigned.</p>
<p>The resignation is with immediate effect.</p>
<p>No reasons were given for Baker's departure.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
